        "text_hN04fvoHR0W4MrlK": "<p>Lio offers nicotine-free, naturally flavored air to help you quit bad habits effortlessly. 100% natural and 90% cheaper than smoking, it keeps the hand-to-mouth habit for an easy transition. </p><p></p><p>Trusted by 50,000+ customers and backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee, it’s the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p>",
