        "text_2OlDmDQbhdm0I64s": "<p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_bC5sMf0wQUOtp5Ww": "<p><strong>Shipping & Refunds</strong></p>",
        "text_npdrYnE2cBQLIqiz": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands!</p><p></p><p>Delivery takes <strong>2-3 days within Europe</strong>, <strong>3-4 days to the UK</strong>, <strong>4-8 days outside Europe</strong>, and <strong>next-day delivery in the Middle East</strong> (from Dubai). </p><p></p><p>Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>",
        "text_WwYgApfvKZYMW1hr": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>",
        "text_y6a1C6mDaZ4RHzdS": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</li><li><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</li><li><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings.</li></ol>",
        "text_irXtFqATIBWs5NLB": "<p><strong>Is Lio safe?</strong></p>",
        "text_2cvFBPo4OBhdm9Y6": "<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Lio is made from 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It’s completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe, clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>",
        "text_OOl6Oy4QW7kmV2LC": "<p><strong>How long do Flavour Cores last?</strong></p>",
        "text_ZXPGK56xlZlOKHPn": "<p>Each Flavour Core is designed to last up to <strong>2 to 3 days</strong> with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavour for <strong>60 days</strong>.</p>",
        "text_d28kY9JpZN5YVJlh": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>",
        "text_cbntLVoNYlzbxGiz": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>",
        "text_seb6olMAdxVzcWbk": "<p>Need your order shipped today?</p>",
        "text_kkTxG5uJGgIM1pf1": "<p>Place your order within:</p>",
        "text_5qss4lS1bgsY98u1": "<p>Hours</p>",
        "text_IbUEVVyONFtcrpJC": "<p>Minutes</p>",
        "text_Swgvng7LghgKLVjE": "<p>Seconds</p>",
